WEBVTT

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.910
New Town

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.910
New Town

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.750
Purin

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:57.320
Hey, wake up this instant!

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.540
You got your notice, right? What'd it say?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:08.670
Yup, it came. How about you, Purin?

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.550
Naturally, I was accepted into YuVoc!

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.170
Notice of Acceptance

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.170
<b>Yuyu Girls'
 Vocational 
High School</b>

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.470
Wow! Congratulations, Purin!

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.680
And don't call me Purin.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.510
My name is Miku.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
So, what about your results, Serufu?

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:26.190
I was accepted, too...

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.480
Really? Well, you did work hard for 
it in your own way, didn't you?

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:33.150
I suppose I should congratulate you.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:34.780
Now we'll be going to the same—

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.240
<b>Gatagata Girls' High School</b>

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:35.900
...into Gata Girls'.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.120
Gata Girls'? That was your safety school, right?

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.130
What about YuVoc?

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:54.000
Oh, they rejected me.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.970
The walls of an elite high school 
were just too high to scale.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.970
You started mindlessly daydreaming
 in the middle of the exam, didn't you?

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.850
Why are you angry, Purin?

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.100
Stupid Serufu!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.150
The weather sure is nice.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:25.490
<b>Step 1
What is "DIY"?</b>

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.160
What's in a name?

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.740
That which we call a rose

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.000
by any other word

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.920
would smell as sweet.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:35.380
So Romeo would, were he not Romeo called.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.010
Retain that clear perfection...

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.260
<i>That cloud...</i>

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.890
<i>I bet taking a nap on it would be the best.</i>

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.770
That's all for today.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.400
Be sure to review 
and prepare for the next lesson

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:57.610
so that you don't suddenly find yourselves 
unable to keep up in class.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.400
See you tomorrow!

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.820
Man, I'm exhausted.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.660
E-Excuse me...

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.540
Huh?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.210
Class is over now...

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.670
Bye-bye!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.420
See you tomorrow.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.170
With a Gentle Face
 and Kind Words

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.170
Takumin, have you decided on a club?

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.550
"Takumin"?

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.260
Hmm?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.430
N-No, not yet.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.180
Have you, Yua-san?

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.180
Not yet.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.560
What should I pick?

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.020
Call me Serufu, Takumin.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:33.940
Takumin...

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.780
Um, my name is Takumi.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.690
I know. That makes you "Takumin."

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:45.490
Takumin? This is the first time 
anyone has called me anything like—

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.240
The wind sure is strong, isn't it?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.000
The buildings funnel it.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:08.470
<b>Gatagata Girls' High School</b>

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:08.470
<b>Yuyu Girls' Vocational High School</b>

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.730
I wonder why they built things this way.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.140
Beats me.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.730
Well, see you tomorrow, Takumin.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.320
G-Goodbye, Serufu-san.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.820
Takumin, huh?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.580
Going is fine...

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.040
but coming back is rough.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.000
Must be nice to ride a school bus.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.000
New Town

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.000
New Town

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.970
Oh, Purin! Welcome back.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.640
I've already mastered using a 3D printer.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:56.440
Today, I made a blood vessel which 
could be used in an actual surgery.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.230
Wow, that's amazing.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:03.320
I learned about 
Emperor Marcus Aurelius Antoninus.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.450
We learned about global 
cutting-edge technology,

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.200
while you studied moldy old history.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.540
It suits you.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.250
D'aw, I'm not that impressive.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.290
That wasn't a compliment!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.250
You could at least wear your shirt neatly!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.710
Hey, Purin!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.540
Why don't you come have a snack?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:27.550
I am allergic to cats, dogs, 
pigs, and you, Serufu!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.560
Stupid Serufu!

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.560
Well, I guess it's fine.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.730
Honestly!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.070
Welcome home, Miku-san.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.030
Welcome home, Miku-san.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.440
Yes, yes.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.740
I'm back.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.700
Very good. I will heat up the bath.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.620
Bath! Bath! Bath!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.160
Bath! Bath!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.160
Why...?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.960
I'm home!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.670
Okay, bring it!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.510
I'm home, Pochi, Tama, Meat!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:14.770
Welcome home, Serufu. 
I was just getting dinner ready.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.560
Go on and take your bath now.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.360
This really brings me back to life.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.360
S'that feel good, Meat?

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:32.370
Hey, Pochi. It'd be great 
if steam was edible, wouldn't it?

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.250
But do you think it would taste good?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.500
I'd put sugar on it.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.290
Or maybe soy sauce...

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.630
<b>Not Disgusting 
Ponzu Sauce</b>

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.920
I'm sure steam tastes best with ponzu sauce!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.460
I like it! You're smart, mom!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.010
Right?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:52.010
Ponzu, huh? Yeah, ponzu for sure.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.510
Oh, this pork shabu shabu is yummy!

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.780
I'm off!

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:18.830
I wonder when someone will 
start selling flying bicycles.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.710
It'd be just a short flight to schoo—

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:28.050
The chain slipped off, 
and the handlebars are twisted....

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.720
There isn't even a bike shop around here.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.220
I'm probably gonna be late now...

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.810
Welp, all good.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:46.480
Ow!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.530
Ooh, not good. Not good at all.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.570
Got a flat?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.240
Huh?

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.160
Oh, it's not a flat. 
My chain and handlebars are...

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.750
Hang on a sec.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.460
Huh?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.670
Wow.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:13.760
Huh?

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.060
There. Fixed.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.730
Test it out.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.770
Oh, okay.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.150
Wow!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.780
Whoa, what a smooth spin.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.780
Thank you so...

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:43.460
I... didn't get a chance to say thanks.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.540
Ow!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.210
You can take it.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.130
Since the entrance ceremony,
 you've had perfect attendance.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.970
You set a record for yourself, Serufu-san.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.260
Yay!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.260
What're you so happy about?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.560
I was spacing out.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.390
<b>Sukonbu 
Snack</b>

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.390
The girl who fixed my bicycle...

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.230
I think she was probably an upperclassman.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:10.900
She was wearing shoes with 
wheels and a doggy sticker.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:14.740
Oh, that would be Yasaku-san in third year.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.160
Yasaku-san?

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.370
You know that home improvement center 
on the corner of East Block 3?

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.040
Waku Waku Wan Wan?

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.160
Oh, I know that store.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.290
Her family runs the place.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.000
Wow.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.210
Um, Serufu-san?

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.760
How did you get injured like that?

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.760
Huh? Which injury?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.300
This one? Or maybe this one?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.310
Um, on your legs.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.850
Oh, these?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.520
I ran into a streetlight on my bike.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.940
What?!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.650
Then this upperclassman who was passing by

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.280
went swish, tap, tap, tap!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:57.700
She fixed up my bike in a flash.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.320
But I didn't get a chance to thank her.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.040
That upperclassman...

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:09.670
I've heard rumors about Yasaku Rei.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:18.300
I'm scared! Run away! No!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.800
Like she'll come after you 
with a hammer out of nowhere.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:21.550
Sh-She's that scary?

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.810
It might be best to convey 
your gratitude properly.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.190
I promise I'll come back alive,
 okay, Takumin?

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:34.650
O-Okay.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.820
Yeah, I saw it! It was insane, right?

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.570
Totally insane. It was hilarious, right?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.410
Um, excuse me.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.290
Huh? What is it?

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.660
I'm looking for Yasaku-san, but...

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.460
She's probably out behind the main building.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.500
Behind the main building?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.130
She's always hanging around the shed out back.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.720
Behind the main building...

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.220
in a shed?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.350
Is this the place?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.020
I wonder what this place is.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:10.890
It says...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:16.480
Does that say "ro"? Or maybe "mouth"?

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.900
Wh-What's that?

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.700
<i>Hmm...</i>

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.830
<i>The window panes are dirty.</i>

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.830
<i>I have to thank her properly.</i>

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.590
Um, hello...

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.970
<i>She'll come after you 
with a hammer out of nowhere.</i>

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:04.820
What're you doing?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.910
Oh, I-I was just a little surprised.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:11.990
I thought you might split my head open.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:12.910
Huh?

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:14.950
No, I'm sorry!

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:19.420
You fixed my bicycle this morning,
but I didn't get to say thanks.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.590
You really saved me. I super appreciate it!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.170
Sure.

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.050
That'll do it.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.010
And now...

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.930
Sorry for bothering you.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.230
<i>We should be okay now.</i>

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.280
Um, Yasaku-senpai...

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.410
What are you making?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.160
A bookstand.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.250
A bookstand?

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.130
Even though they sell them in stores?

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:04.500
Huh?

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.510
S-Sorry...

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.430
There wasn't one the right size.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:16.970
<i>Huh... And so she's making one herself?</i>

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:22.770
<i>Could it be that she built 
this shed herself, too?</i>

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.650
<i>That'd be cool.</i>

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:31.740
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Hup! Hup!

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.210
Cocoa is yummy.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.000
Cocoa...

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.380
Want to try it?

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.710
Huh?

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.550
To make the screwing easier,

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.470
drill your holes first.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.060
Once you've made the holes,

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.730
swap your drill bit...

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.980
for a Phillips attachment.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.450
Then tighten those screws in.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.280
Like this.

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.200
Wow.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:18.580
Here.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.240
Huh?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.910
Oh, okay.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:22.960
This is heavy.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.290
When you pull the trigger,

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.710
the bit will rotate at high speed.

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:28.960
The trigger?

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.880
Whoa.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.390
Try screwing this one in.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.760
This one?

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:39.930
Try pulling the trigger slowly 
at first, little by little,

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:42.140
or else it'll take your arm for a ride.

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:43.390
Be careful, okay?

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:44.270
Huh?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.070
Hold it firm and straight...

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.990
Pull the trigger little by little...

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.080
H-Hey! Are you okay?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.330
Y-Yeah. I'm great.

00:15:08.750 --> 00:15:10.590
Okay, there we go.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.340
I don't think you've broken anything,

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:17.180
but if the pain persists, 
make sure you go to a hospital.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.890
Have them do an X-ray, all right?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:21.810
All right.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.530
Purin! Welcome home.

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:40.990
You've always been clumsy, haven't you?

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:41.740
Urk.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.040
You really are clumsy. Always have been.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:53.170
I can't even tell you how many 
times you've hurt yourself.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:58.760
Serufu-chan, shall I do that for you?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.390
It's fine! I got this!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.020
Serufu-chan!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.350
I can do that.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.900
This is a piece of cake! No prob!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.730
But if you hurt yourself again...

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.400
My hand!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.690
Serufu-chan!

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.200
Crafts are forbidden!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.860
Crafts are now prohibited!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:20.070
What?!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.450
Instead, use these to draw.

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:25.620
Okay.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:31.250
I'm glad I was extra-careful and gave 
you crayons that were safe to eat.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.920
I have no idea how many you gobbled.

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:36.590
What a problem child.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.510
You ate those drawings you did of fruit, too.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.470
Don't laugh me off like that.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.810
Honestly.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:00.450
Open wide, Purin-chan!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.000
Now it's your turn, Serufu-chan.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.120
Here. Open wide.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.710
Gosh. Serufu-chan, you silly...

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.690
<i>When we were little, together we'd...</i>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.200
That's it.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.580
Maybe if that bench were there,

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.620
then Purin and I might still...

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.630
Hey, hey!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:59.760
Suridecchi, what're you 
doing for your elective?

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.340
"Suridecchi"?

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:02.890
Meow?

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.430
Meow?

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:16.900
<i>If I'm gonna make a bench, I wonder if I'll 
be able to borrow materials and tools...</i>

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:18.860
Excuse me!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.860
<i>Haruko-sensei?</i>

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:25.160
The only member now is you, 
the club leader. Right, Yasaku-san?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.160
<i>Oh, they're in the middle of a conversation!</i>

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.160
<b>Yasaku Rei</b>

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:29.040
According to school rules,

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.500
if there aren't at least five members,

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.790
we can't officially recognize the club.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.920
I see.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:39.170
That's all right.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:43.130
But, you see, if the school 
doesn't recognize the club,

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.430
then they won't provide funds either.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.550
That would be a problem, wouldn't it?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.770
I asked the principal about it.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:54.190
If you have five members
 by the end of the term,

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.060
the principal says you can be an official club.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:58.860
By the end of the term?

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:05.700
What do you think?
Can you make it to five members?

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.200
For now, I've got one.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.540
Hey! Stop sneaking around and come in here!

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.210
Huh?

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:18.090
H-Hello!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.090
Oh, Serufu-san.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.380
<i>"Self"?</i>

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:23.670
Yesterday, she joined on a trial basis.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:24.800
My, really?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:25.470
Huh?

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.720
You did this screw, didn't you?

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:30.220
Oh, that's amazing!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.810
It's finished.

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:35.020
Huh?

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.230
But this is a little crooked.

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:41.980
It's not like I'm selling it, 
so that much isn't a problem.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.610
In fact, it gives it character!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:50.160
I see. This is the screw I did...

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.000
Will you be joining this club permanently?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:54.870
Yes!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.250
I am...?

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.420
You're going to join, right?

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.130
Y-Yes!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.880
I am...?

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.260
You're joining, right?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.400
<i>Making things yourself, huh?</i>

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:21.230
<i>If I join,</i>

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:24.110
<i>will I be able to make things myself one day?</i>

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.160
<i>Here. Open wide, Serufu-chan.</i>

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.530
Yes! I'll join the club.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.040
Really?

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:39.920
Then we have President Yasaku Rei-san

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.540
and new student Serufu-san for members.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.380
Now you only need three more.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:48.430
By the way, I'm the advisor for 
this club. We're glad to have you.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.550
Thanks for looking after us.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.310
Application to Join Club Activities

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.680
Write down your name and class number.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:02.060
Serufu

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:02.060
Yua

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:02.060
How do you read that?

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:05.070
It's Yua. Yua Serufu.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.690
Yua Serufu?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.070
She's a perfect fit for this club!

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.700
She is, isn't she?

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:12.990
Um...

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:16.500
This is a carpentry club, right?

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:19.330
It's a little different than a carpentry club.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:21.790
This is the DIY club.

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:24.500
What is "DIY"?

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.750
An abbreviation.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:26.760
For what?

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:29.340
Do it...

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:31.720
Yua Serufu.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.100
What?

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:36.850
Do it yourself.

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:42.020
Duu eet yoor serufu?

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.980
<i>Here, furniture and friendships,</i>

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:50.360
<i>and by extension people's lives, 
are hammered out.</i>

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:52.570
<i>Through grueling labor and mistakes,</i>

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.530
<i>these girls never give up.</i>

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:56.620
They finish what they start with their own hands.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.000
<i>They're carving the paths to their futures,</i>

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:03.960
<i>and this is the story of their very first steps.</i>

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.960
<i></i>
